Add the smallest deterministic retirement planner and managed alias-retirement mechanism needed
to produce a reviewable exact manifest for the canonical 259 retained generated sources. The
planner must inventory inbound references, classify required preservation, bind every candidate to
its current source hash and active retained-source alias, and refuse drift or ambiguity. Dry-run
must not mutate files or SQLite. Applying alias retirement remains separate from filesystem
deletion and requires the exact current project binding, database revision, domain digest, and
manifest token.

